{
  "name": "CRM · Task due → Telegram reminder",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Task reminders\nSubscribe this Webhook to `task.due`. Sends a Telegram message when a task becomes due. Create a bot with @BotFather, put its token and your chat ID in **CRM config**. For WhatsApp, swap the last node for the WhatsApp Business Cloud node.",
